## 13. Limitations

* AI-generated recommendations require engineering verification.
* Similarity analysis cannot guarantee global project originality.
* Component prices are estimates unless verified with current suppliers.
* Hardware recommendations should be validated before purchasing.
* AI debugging suggestions cannot replace physical testing.
* Final circuit performance depends on actual hardware implementation.

